WEBVTT

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:32.438
And conversely, if somebody
sends me hate mail --

00:19:32.462 --> 00:19:34.764
which happens daily --

00:19:34.788 --> 00:19:36.840
I say, "Piss off."

00:19:39.508 --> 00:19:40.825
(Laughter)

00:19:40.849 --> 00:19:43.321
[I admire your frankness ...]

00:19:43.345 --> 00:19:44.976
(Laughter)

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:50.353
(Applause)

00:19:50.377 --> 00:19:52.976
So that's my dirty little secret.
Don't tell anyone.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.115
(Laughter)

00:19:54.139 --> 00:19:56.976
So the point is --
this is a really interesting story.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.878
This is version eight of this software,

00:19:58.902 --> 00:20:01.100
and do you know what they put
in version eight?